Description: dupli.back Backup software
 dupli.back Backup software for Linux Originally based on 'flyback', which was based on Apple's 'Time Machine'. 
 Dupli.back, is a full featured backup application built on top of the duplicity command line backup tool. It supports 
 password encrypted backup, backing up on remote servers via ssh, backing up on Amazon Cloud S3 service & backing up on 
 local and removable disks. 
